--- etc_lookup.py (old)
+++ etc_lookup.py (new)
- _load_from_disk_cache: returned the cached page whatever it contained.
- _save_to_disk_cache: wrote straight into part_N.html (a crash left a truncated page).
- _fetch_part_page: no lock, timeout=timeout.
+ stub pages (no '<h3 id="X') older than 24 h are re-fetched, saves are atomic (temp file +
+ os.replace), one download per part at a time (threading.Lock), timeout=(5, timeout),
+ and a new find_center_html() shared with etc_position.py.
